{"question_id": "06878be2", "question_type": "single-session-preference", "response": "Based on your current setup — Sony A7R IV, Sony 24-70mm f/2.8 lens, and your decision to go with the Godox V1 flash — here are accessories that would complement it:\n\n**For your Godox V1 flash:**\n- **Godox V1 Hard Case** ($25) — protection for the flash\n- **Think Tank Photo Flash Pouch** ($15) or **Lowepro Flash Pouch** ($20) — convenient carrying\n- A **battery pack** for extended shoots: Anker PowerCore 20000 PD ($60), Jackery Titan S 20000 ($70), or the more compact Anker PowerCore Fusion ($40)\n\n**For the Gitzo GT3543LS tripod you're considering:**\n- **Gitzo GH3382QD ballhead** — stated to be compatible with that tripod (or any head with a 3/8\" thread)\n\n**For your lens care:**\n- Soft dry microfiber cloth, lens cleaning tissue, or pre-moistened wipes — wipe from the center outward in a circular motion (avoid paper towels, household cleaners, and excessive pressure)\n\n**For your camera bag upgrade:**\n- Brands recommended as Sony-compatible: **Think Tank Photo, Lowepro, F-Stop Gear, Peak Design, and MindShift Gear**. A personalized pick would need your budget, gear capacity needs, style preference, and whether it's for travel or everyday use.", "n_records": 39, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 3888, "completion_tokens": 2098, "calls": 2}, "selected": ["self|camera_body", "self|flash_upgrade_interest", "self|flash_choice", "self|flash_purchase_decision", "self|lens", "self|lens_cleaning_concern", "self|tripod_interest", "self|camera_bag_upgrade", "self|camera_bag_research", "assistant|flash_recommendation", "assistant|godox_v1|flash_build_comparison", "assistant|sony_hvl_f60rm|flash_build_comparison", "assistant|flash_weather_sealing", "assistant|flash_battery_life", "assistant|flash_recycle_time", "assistant|flash_case_recommendation", "assistant|flash_pouch_recommendation", "assistant|battery_pack_recommendation", "assistant|lens_cleaning_guide", "assistant|lens_cleaning_wa